                                                "sense_id": "987913a4-e5a5-38ca-9496-c16364af1dab",
                                                "text": "By the end of the year all new electrification projects were virtually complete and conversion of the remaining three-phase 3,700V a.c. sections to 3,000V d.c. was well in hand."
